# Allowlist. The core image (Dockerfile) needs only the project metadata, the
# lockfile, and the package source; tests/ is here for tests.Dockerfile, which
# shares this build context. Nothing under tests/ can reach the core image: the
# wheel is built from src/rc_dynamo alone and the dependency layer is exported
# from uv.lock, which holds no test tooling.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!tests/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
